{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263ig6eBooYj1794388101.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方在黃大仙一輛可疑私家車，搜獲懷疑毒品，正追捕司機。</p><p></p><p>警員圍封涉事私家車，出動毒品搜查犬搜索車廂，在車內檢獲懷疑毒品。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.DRUG-1530_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pgktZmt7mF1794388109.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方稱，中午12時許在橫頭磡南路，發現形跡可疑的私家車，嘗試截停但不成功，隨後在鳳德道、雙鳳街交界，發現私家車停在路旁，司機逃去無蹤，暫時未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:09.483610+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T14:37:16.716480+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:21.582469+00:00","content_hash":"4c7daa937b0493cbb37b1394765be9fad443f872f9c73fed7881c86c19440d18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:09.483610+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}